# Manuscript and submission materials stay local while the Special Issue runs
# double-blind review. The laboratories, the protocol, the test suite and the generated
# dataset are the published artifact; the paper about them is not.
# `node tools/manuscript-tables.mjs --check` skips cleanly when paper/ is absent, so
# `npm run validate` still passes on a fresh clone.
